Note on data: the licence above covers the code and the site's own texts and
graphics. The data files in site/data/ are not covered; they belong to their
sources and keep their own terms:

- U.S. Energy Information Administration (EIA) and FRED (Federal Reserve Bank
  of St. Louis; underlying data from the EIA): U.S. public domain. Please
  credit the source ("Source: U.S. Energy Information Administration";
  "Source: FRED, Federal Reserve Bank of St. Louis").
- JODI Oil World Database: please credit JODI.
- Our World in Data (if used): CC BY 4.0, attribution required.
- News headlines, snippets and links: all rights remain with the respective
  publishers; this site only links to them.
- site/data/manual.json is a hand-maintained ledger of estimates attributed
  to their named sources.
